        " principal, and call this on their acceptance. It checks that the"
        " Charter is sealed, every flag disposed, a closing run logged, the"
        " judged tree unchanged since that run, and lint clean — then closes"
        " the mission."),
        help="the principal's sign-off, recorded: run the"
                                    " full-scope gate first (`mp run record"
                                    " --scope closing`), present the result, and"
                                    " call this on their acceptance. It checks"
                                    " Charter sealed, flags disposed, a closing"
                                    " run logged, the judged tree unchanged"
                                    " since it ran, lint clean — then closes the"
                                    " mission")
